{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b891403a-f6d5-89b5-8a7b-1e4122d422ba",
  "created_at": "2026-02-18T12:10:42-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:01:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:01:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good afternoon. I'm calling about some bulk waste that got left out on the curb. Furniture and stuff, from a move-out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:01:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. Is this at your own home, or is it somewhere else you're reporting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:01:40-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's my house. I own it, but I rent out the upstairs unit. Well, not me, the landlord thing is a long story. The prior tenant moved out over the weekend and the landlord just left everything out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:02:05-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on, let me make sure I've got that right. You're the homeowner, and the previous tenant moved out, and the landlord put the items at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:02:24-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, so the landlord who manages the upstairs, he left it. A mattress, a couple of chairs, a broken dresser, some bags of I don't know what. It's been sitting there since Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:02:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. A mattress, chairs, a dresser, and some bags. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:02:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "256 Malbone Road. That's in the North End, up toward the Middletown line a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:03:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "256 Malbone Road. Okay. Let me just type that in. [pause] Alright. Now, is any of it blocking the sidewalk or the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:03:21-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The dresser is kind of half on the sidewalk. People can get around it, but it's wicked awkward with a stroller or anything. The rest is on the grass strip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:03:41-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note the dresser on the sidewalk. Was any of this set out with a sticker or a tag, or anything from the city on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:03:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing. No sticker. I looked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:04:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Usually bulk items need to be scheduled ahead of time, so it sounds like it just got dumped out there without that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:04:19-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's what I figured. So my question is, is there a fee for picking it up? Because I don't want to get stuck paying for something that isn't mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 41,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Generally bulk pickup can have a fee depending on the item, a mattress is one that usually does. I don't have the exact amounts in front of me, so I'd have the crew supervisor tell you for your case. Who ends up being billed depends on who set it out, so I'll write down that it was the landlord and not you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:05:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that'd be good. Because I didn't put it there, and I didn't schedule anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And do you know the landlord's name, or is it just the person who manages the unit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not put his name on it, I mean I know it, but I'd just say the property manager for the upstairs unit. Is that enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:06:00-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine for now. I'll put property manager of the upstairs unit set out the items. If the inspector needs the name they can ask you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:06:17-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Sorry, one sec, I've got something on the stove. [pause] Okay, I'm back. I'm trying a new chili recipe and I put way too much cumin in it, so I'm standing here trying to fix it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Take your time. Let me ask you a few more things. Is there anything in those bags that might be hazardous? Paint, chemicals, batteries, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:07:01-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think so. They look like clothes and kitchen stuff, but I haven't opened them. One of them has a tear and I can see a towel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:07:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so likely household items. And the mattress, is it out in the open, or is it wrapped?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:07:32-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not wrapped. It's just leaning on the fence post. It got a little damp yesterday from the drizzle."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll note it's unwrapped and damp. That can matter for how they pick it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:07:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:07:57-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So let me read it back. Bulk items at 256 Malbone Road: a mattress, two chairs, a dresser partly on the sidewalk, and a few bags, left Sunday after a tenant move-out by the property manager, no sticker, and you'd like to know about any fee. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:08:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's all of it. Two chairs, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:08:36-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Can I get a good callback number in case the supervisor needs to reach you about the fee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:08:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:08:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, it's my cell. I'm out in the car right now but I'll hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:09:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Somebody should get back to you, and the pickup would likely be within the next several days depending on the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And should I leave it where it is, or move the dresser off the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:09:32-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If you can slide it onto the grass without hurting yourself, that's helpful. But don't lift anything heavy. If it's too much, leave it and I've noted it's on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll see if I can push it over. It's not that heavy, it's mostly the drawers."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:10:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You could take the drawers out first, that makes it easier."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:10:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good idea. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is there anything else I can help you with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:10:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks for your help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Cristina. Enjoy the rest of your lunch, and good luck with the chili."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-18T12:10:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bye bye."
    }
  ],
